            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Manda"
            },
            "reviewBody": "The sauce was good and it went well on the little smokies (I used smokies instead of kielbasa, just because I had some little smokies I wanted to get rid of!) and it was good. The sauce was a little thin - I think next time I'll take the lid off for the last half hour of cooking so it can thicken up.",
            "datePublished": "2012-01-11T17:37:35.283Z"
